# Env files

The only env files are:

- `web/.env.example`
- `mac/.env.example`
- `android/.env.example`

Do not add `.env`, `.env.local`, or `.env.production`. Each `.env.example` has `GATEWAY_PUBLIC_URL` and an empty `GATEWAY_TOKEN`. The live token is the GitHub secret `GATEWAY_TOKEN`, not a value in the repo. Android Gradle and the Mac app read `.env.example` and send that token on `hello`.
